{"script":"s_3_3_6_n","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"柏莉尔之母","text":"[show]嗯……你们还没做好那种饮料吗？有 [color=ffb64d]1 份清凉水露果饮[colorEnd]就可以了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"柏莉尔之母","text":"[show]快到晚饭时间了，我想如果在晚饭之前把这东西送给孩子们，他们一定会更开心的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"柏莉尔之母","text":"[show]他们现在还在外面玩呢，拜托你们了……[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"柏莉尔的母亲互动【（将饮料交给柏莉尔的母亲。）】"}